#: src/dialogs/prefs-default-grid.xml:49(para)
#| msgid ""
#| "This page lets you customize the default properties of GIMP's grid, which "
#| "can be toggled on or off using "
#| "<menuchoice><guimenu>View</guimenu><guimenuitem>Show "
#| "Grid</guimenuitem></menuchoice> from the image menu. The settings here match"
#| " those in the Configure Image Grid dialog, which can be used to reconfigure "
#| "the grid for an existing image, by choosing "
#| "<menuchoice><guimenu>Image</guimenu><guimenuitem>Configure "
#| "Grid</guimenuitem></menuchoice> from the image menu. See the <link "
#| "linkend=\"gimp-configure-grid-dialog\">Configure Grid dialog</link> section "
#| "for information on the meaning of each of the settings."
msgid ""
"The settings here match those in the Configure Image Grid dialog, which can "
"be used to reconfigure the grid for an existing image, by choosing "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Image</guimenu><guimenuitem>Configure "
"Grid</guimenuitem></menuchoice> from the main menu. See the <link "
"linkend=\"gimp-configure-grid-dialog\">Configure Grid dialog</link> section "
"for information on the meaning of each of the settings."
msgstr ""
"As configurações aqui correspondem às do diálogo Configurar grade da imagem,"
" que pode ser usado para reconfigurar a grade de uma imagem existente, "
"escolhendo <menuchoice><guimenu>Imagem</guimenu><guimenuitem>Configurar "
"grade</guimenuitem></menuchoice> no menu principal. Veja a seção <link "
"linkend=\"gimp-configure-grid-dialog\">diálogo Configurar grade</link> para "
"informações sobre o significado de cada uma das configurações."

